---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, categoryOf } from '../data/site';

const interests = ['programming-language', 'game-dev', 'ai'].map(categoryOf);
const principles = [
  '很多事都是熟能生巧，没有足够的练习不要谈天赋。练习不是一味的重复，或者去完全复刻别人的代码，每一次练习都应该增加难度，有突破自己认知的成长。这样反复的经过输入、评估、输出、纠正，会有惊人的变化。',
  '英语水平决定了一个程序员的上限。',
  '要有良好的习惯，才能事半功倍。',
  '不要等准备好了再出发，优秀的程序员都是探路者。',
  '愚者困惑，智者提问。',
  '最简单的往往是最有效的。',
  '向成功者学习，向成功的项目学习。',
  '输出是最好的输入。',
  '一定要坚持，保持长时间学习，甚至终身学习的态度。',
  '一定要动手，不管例子多么简单，建议至少自己动手敲一遍看看是否理解了里头的细枝末节。',
  '一定要学会思考，思考为什么要这样，而不是那样。还要举一反三地思考。',
  '不要乱买书，不要乱追新技术新名词，基础的东西经过很长时间积累，会在未来至少 10 年通用。',
  '回顾一下历史，看看历史时间线上技术的发展，你才能明白明天会是什么样的。',
];
const zen = [
  'Beautiful is better than ugly. 优美胜于丑陋',
  'Explicit is better than implicit. 明了胜于晦涩',
  'Simple is better than complex. 简洁胜于复杂',
  'Complex is better than complicated. 复杂胜于凌乱',
  'Flat is better than nested. 扁平胜于嵌套',
  'Sparse is better than dense. 间隔胜于紧凑',
  'Readability counts. 可读性很重要',
  "Special cases aren't special enough to break the rules. 任何特例都不足够违背这些原则",
  'Although practicality beats purity. 实用性高于纯粹性',
  'Errors should never pass silently. 错误永远不应该被静默处理',
  'Unless explicitly silenced. 除非明确地让它静默',
  'In the face of ambiguity, refuse the temptation to guess. 面对二义性，拒绝猜测的诱惑',
  'There should be one-- and preferably only one --obvious way to do it. 应该有一种——而且最好只有一种——明显的方法去做一件事',
  "Although that way may not be obvious at first unless you're Dutch. 虽然那种方法一开始可能并不明显，除非你是 Python 之父",
  'Now is better than never. 现在做总比不做好',
  'Although never is often better than *right* now. 但永远不做通常比贸然行动好',
  "If the implementation is hard to explain, it's a bad idea. 如果实现很难解释，它就不是好主意",
  'If the implementation is easy to explain, it may be a good idea. 如果实现容易解释，它可能是一个好主意',
  "Namespaces are one honking great idea -- let's do more of those! 命名空间是一个绝妙的主意——我们应该多多使用",
];
---

<Base title="关于">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-14">
    <header class="border-b border-line pb-10 dark:border-line-dark">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
        <img src={SITE.avatar} alt={SITE.author} width="72" height="72" class="h-18 w-18 rounded-full border border-line object-cover shadow-sm dark:border-line-dark" />
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">About / 关于</p>
          <h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">你好，我是 Ferris。</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-8 text-ink-soft dark:text-snow-soft">
            一名开发者。兴趣方向涵盖游戏开发、编程语言与 AI Agent——从引擎到游戏，从理论到实践。这里是我的个人博客，用来记录学习笔记与一些思考。
          </p>
          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
            <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full bg-ink px-4 text-sm font-medium text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-ink/85 dark:bg-snow dark:text-night dark:hover:bg-snow/85">
              GitHub <span class="ml-1.5" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-full border border-line px-4 text-sm text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:border-ink/20 hover:text-ink dark:border-line-dark dark:text-snow-soft dark:hover:border-white/20 dark:hover:text-snow">
              {SITE.email}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="interests-heading" class="mt-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">Interests / 研究方向</p>
      <h2 id="interests-heading" class="sr-only">研究方向</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {interests.map((cat, index) => (
          <a href={`/categories/${cat.slug}/`} class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper-elev p-5 transition-colors hover:border-ink/20 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-night-elev dark:hover:border-white/20">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint dark:text-snow-faint">0{index + 1}</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${cat.accent};`}>{cat.mark}</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-lg font-bold transition-colors group-hover:text-accent dark:group-hover:text-accent-dark">{cat.label}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft dark:text-snow-soft">{cat.description}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="principles-heading" class="mt-14">
      <p class="eyebrow">Notes to self</p>
      <h2 id="principles-heading" class="mt-2 font-serif text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">一些相信的事</h2>
      <ol class="mt-5 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-10">
        {principles.map((principle, index) => (
          <li class="flex gap-4 border-t border-line py-4 dark:border-line-dark">
            <span class="shrink-0 font-mono text-xs leading-7 text-ink-faint dark:text-snow-faint">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft dark:text-snow-soft">{principle}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="quotes-heading" class="mt-14">
      <p class="eyebrow">On practice</p>
      <h2 id="quotes-heading" class="mt-2 font-serif text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">实践与长期主义</h2>
      <blockquote class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-accent/50 pl-5 text-[0.9375rem] leading-8 text-ink-soft dark:border-accent-dark/50 dark:text-snow-soft">
        <p>Write lots of code. Clone existing things as exercises. Learn deeply. Alternate trying yourself and reading literature. Be obsessive.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Most of my programming career has involved finding something neat, writing my own version to understand it &amp; often throwing it away.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">I program those "clones" like I read papers: change a core part; redesign it. Gain progress or understanding why it is what it is.</p>
        <footer class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint dark:text-snow-faint">—— John Carmack</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-14 space-y-4">
      <details class="about-disclosure rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper-elev p-5 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-night-elev">
        <summary>The Zen of Python <span class="text-xs font-normal text-ink-faint dark:text-snow-faint">Tim Peters</span></summary>
        <div class="prose-custom mt-5">
          <pre><code class="language-python">import this</code></pre>
          <ol>{zen.map((line) => <li>{line}</li>)}</ol>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="about-disclosure rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper-elev p-5 dark:border-line-dark dark:bg-night-elev">
        <summary>文档格式约定</summary>
        <div class="prose-custom mt-5">
          <p><strong>加粗字体</strong>通常用于关键字、类名等信息，通常不需要上下文即可理解，例如 <strong>Object</strong>、<strong>TreeNode</strong>。</p>
          <p><code>inline_code</code> 通常用于属性名、方法名、执行命令等，例如 <code>_init()</code> 表示某个类或对象的初始化方法。</p>
          <p><em>倾斜字体</em>用于提示特别注意；<sub>小字</sub>用于表示注释；<span class="text-accent dark:text-accent-dark">彩色字体</span>用于强调关键信息；<u>下划线字体</u>一般配合脚注使用。</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
